# Mantine

- UI stack: Mantine (`@mantine/core`, `@mantine/hooks`, `@mantine/form`, `@mantine/notifications`).
- Icons: `@tabler/icons-react`.
- Do not use Tailwind utility classes for styling or layout.
- Use Mantine layout primitives (`Stack`, `Group`, `Box`, `Center`, `Grid`) and component props.
- Import UI primitives only from local wrappers in `@/components/ui/...`.
- Component defaults live in `lib/theme.ts` (`theme.components`), not in feature code.
- Theme: Mantine is the source of truth. Telegram only toggles `light`/`dark` via `TelegramColorSchemeSync`.
- Primary color key: `primary` (pastel blue palette in `lib/theme.ts`).

```tsx
// BAD
import { Button } from '@mantine/core'
<div className="flex gap-4 p-6">

// GOOD
import Button from '@/components/ui/Button/Button'
<Stack gap="md" p="md">
```
